&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in operationally intensive roles (marketplace, data ops, logistics, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ year of people management with clear impact on team performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics-driven with a systems-thinking approach to operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning delivery outcomes across multi-stakeholder, high-velocity projects&lt;/li&gt;
