&lt;li&gt;Must be proficient in using LLMs in your every day work, including building scripting logic and working with large datasets with LLM assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ year in AI data operations (RLHF, annotation, model evaluation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;STEM background or strong technical fluency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python &amp;amp; REACT working knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
