&lt;p&gt;At HumanSignal we pay based on regional compensation market rate ranges across the globe. We are hiring for this role across North and South America as well as Europe. The base cash compensation range is $140,000 to $200,000 USD. These ranges are provided by market data and are in good faith. The final offer details are determined by several factors including candidate experience, expertise, as well as applicable industry knowledge and may vary from the pay ranges listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It’s an exciting time at HumanSignal.&lt;/strong&gt; We’re growing quickly, and roles evolve as we learn. We’ve put thought into your first initiatives, but we’ll refine them together. If this sounds exciting, come build with us.&lt;/p&gt;

