&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Design and deliver project-specific training collateral within tight timelines (often 24–48 hours) for new AI data labeling programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop training materials — written guides, annotated examples, rubrics, and assessments — that translate complex technical task requirements into clear contributor instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Analyze learner performance data, error patterns, and quality issues to identify training gaps and design targeted interventions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Train and coach operations staff (SPLs, Ops Associates) on instructional design principles, feedback techniques, and quality assessment methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build reusable content templates, frameworks, and self-serve resources to maintain training consistency across projects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Continuously track training effectiveness via quality metrics, completion rates, and satisfaction scores — and iterate quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product and Engineering to surface tooling improvements that support contributor learning at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
